# TextField

> Lede 0.6.0's docs for TextField, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/text-field.md

A labeled `<input>`, or a `<textarea>` when given `rows`, on Base UI Field, with its hint and error wired up for assistive tech.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/text-field
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md) and [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md), and the npm packages `@base-ui/react@^1.9.0`. The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.6.0/text-field.json.

## Import

```tsx
import { TextField } from '@/components/lede/text-field';
```

## Files and exports

| Installs to | Import from | Exports |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `components/lede/text-field.tsx` | `@/components/lede/text-field` | `TextField` (component), `TextFieldProps` (type) |

## Props

Base UI Field: a real `<label>` and a real `<input>` or `<textarea>`, with the hint and error wired up for assistive tech.

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `label` (required) | `React.ReactNode` |  |  |
| `hint` | `React.ReactNode` |  | Helper text, linked to the input with `aria-describedby`. |
| `error` | `React.ReactNode` |  | Error message. It marks the field invalid and replaces the hint. Word it as the fix, such as "Enter your name." |
| `size` | `'md' \| 'lg'` |  |  |
| `className` | `string` |  | On the wrapper `<div>` that holds the label, the field and the hint. |
| `ref` | `React.Ref<HTMLInputElement>` |  |  |

TextField also takes the attributes of `<input>` or `<textarea>`, whichever it renders, such as `aria-describedby`.

## Example

The smallest working use, from the docs site:

```tsx
import { TextField } from '@/components/lede/text-field';

export function ContactFields({ emailError }: { emailError?: string }) {
  return (
    <>
      <TextField label="Display name" name="name" autoComplete="name" hint="Shown to people you share with." />
      <TextField label="Email" name="email" type="email" autoComplete="email" error={emailError} />
    </>
  );
}
```

Docs: [Components](https://lede.cloudcompute.com/components.md).

